# Line endings are decided here, not by each contributor's git config.
#
# Without this file a Windows clone with the common core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF
# in the working tree, and `prettier --check` — part of `npm run lint`, and a CI
# gate — fails on files that were never touched. Normalizing to LF everywhere
# keeps the checkout identical on every platform; Go, Node and the shell scripts
# in this repo all read LF happily on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
